QBE backend vendored in libs/qbe
================================
Upstream: git://c9x.me/qbe.git
Pinned tag: v1.3
Pinned commit: c0818978acec60ebb6167fade60fb7012cbf20ca (2026-05-12, "reduce memory footprint of strings")

How this was vendored:
  git clone git://c9x.me/qbe.git libs/qbe
  git -C libs/qbe checkout v1.3
  rm -rf libs/qbe/.git

To update to a newer upstream release later:
  rm -rf libs/qbe
  git clone git://c9x.me/qbe.git libs/qbe
  git -C libs/qbe checkout <new-tag>
  rm -rf libs/qbe/.git
  (then update this file with the new tag + commit)

Local additions (NOT upstream, keep on update):
  qbe_lib.h / qbe_lib.c — library shim: same pipeline as main.c's driver
    as a callable API (main.c itself is excluded from the library).
  Makefile.lib — builds libqbe.a (all QBE objects except main.o, plus
    qbe_lib.o) by including the vendored Makefile; no vendored file is
    modified for the library build.
  qbe.odin — Odin wrapper (foreign import of libqbe.a).
